{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIRROR ATELIER: A Cozy Sliding Puzzle Adventure</h2>Step into the enchanting world of Mirror Atelier, a cozy game where <i>captivating stories seamlessly blend with classic sliding puzzles</i>. Familiar sliding puzzle experience is enchanted with delightful fantasy narratives. A game challenging for your perception and delightfull for your artistic senses. A truly captivating mechanical sliding puzzle experience awaits you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766130/extras/58b8b35881dc22367de880628463bd55.avif?t=1769537692\" width=847 height=275 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2>Mirror Atelier features the familiar workings of old-school mechanical sliding puzzles. Each of the 37 levels in the base game is divided into 2 to 3 stages, with complexity increasing as you progress.<br><br>As you solve each stage, story fragments unfold, rewarding your achievement with a sense of amusement and delight. If you prefer to focus on the puzzles, you can skip these fragments and read the complete narratives later in the Stories screen. Stories range from charming small instances to parts of bigger, ongoing sagas.<br><br>Mirror Atelier offers a tranquil and relaxing experience that is both engaging and challenging.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766130/extras/ab933a352ae6974650a1387d0f69fe4b.avif?t=1769537692\" width=1560 height=504 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPLETE STORIES</h2>All ongoing stories are crafted to reach a meaningful, satisfying conclusion. We've carefully curated every narrative to ensure they are entertaining and delightful to read. The game is created with precaution for families and younger audiences, ensuring a wholesome experience. Each series features its own unique setting and story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766130/extras/02f84364233f54df99ae25bf5ca3520c.avif?t=1769537692\" width=1560 height=505 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES as of October 2025</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>37 Levels with multiple stages for hours of puzzling.<br></li><li>30 Achievements to unlock in the base game.<br></li><li>Options to customize gameplay for your taste.<br></li><li>Satisfying puzzles with no timers or leaderboards \u2014 just pure relaxation.<br></li><li>Mysterious and cozy sliding puzzle adventures.<br></li><li>Series of engaging stories to discover as you play.</li></ul><br><br><i>Enter Mirror Atelier today and slide into a world of artistic discovery and narrative charm!</i><br><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Stage Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/214f74215e015115073c4283346dc6ec08726877.jpg"},{"name":"First Level Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/47a7ee77522e96f119a249f9cbbfe2c4b0b83ee7.jpg"},{"name":"First Serie Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/5832be2bef69d41cd835731f1f331d573ef9d0ed.jpg"},{"name":"Second Serie Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/dd0c4821049e9508218c77bd9aea8df181b2eaec.jpg"},{"name":"The Fool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/215f48dfd5cf6a08f7935646040e83af680b7daf.jpg"},{"name":"The Magician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/48dac4e440bd1c35f3b02f39f0da83285eeaea12.jpg"},{"name":"The Priestess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3766130/299bad7579af464a22a71381a6886ac23a0212b6.jpg"},{"name":"The Empress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati